<body class="setupTab" onload="init()" style="background-color: #FFFFFF; bEditID: b1st1; bLabel: body;">
<table cellpadding="0" width="500" cellspacing="0" id="topTable" height="450">
<tbody>
<tr valign="top">
<td style="background-color: #ffffff; beditid: r1st1; blabel: header; vertical-align: top; height: 95; text-align: left;"><img border="0" beditid="r1sp1" blabel="headerImage" id="r1sp1" src="http://c.na12.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=015U0000003sxfg&amp;oid=00DU0000000YT3c" /></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td style="background-color: #ffffff; beditid: r2st1; blabel: accent1; height: 0;"></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td styleinsert="1" height="300" style="background-color: #ffffff; beditid: r3st1; color: #000000; blabel: main; font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400">
<tbody>
<tr valign="top" height="400">
<td teditid="c1r1" style="background-color: #ffffff; beditid: r3st1; color: #000000; blabel: main; font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;" aeditid="c1r1" locked="0">
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Benvenuto al Servizio di Gestione Richieste del Supporto Clienti Intel!.</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"> </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Conservare questa e-mail per futura consultazione. </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"> </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><b>ID accesso: </b>!%UserUserName%!</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><b>Indirizzo e-mail: </b>!%UserEmailAddr%! </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"> </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><b>Che cosa si deve fare </b></span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"> </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Verificare l'indirizzo e-mail facendo clic sul seguente <a href="https://signinpp.intel.com!%ActivationURL%!&amp;culture=it">link</a> o copiando l'URL nel proprio browser. </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"> </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">La password deve essere considerata riservata. L'uso della password e dei siti Web di Intel è regolato dai Termini e Condizioni di utilizzo di Intel, cui è possibile accedere tramite i link riportati in calce a tutte le pagine del sito Web. </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"> </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Per eventuali domande, contattare Intel <a href="http://http://www.intel.com/p/it_IT/support">qui</a>. </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"> </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Visitare questo <a href="http://https://!%tst_us_en%!">link</a> in qualsiasi momento per gestire il proprio profilo. </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"> </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Per favore NON rispondere a questo messaggio e-mail. Questa è una risposta automatica.</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Per assicurarsi di continuare a ricevere le nostre e-mail, aggiungere il nostro indirizzo alla rubrica. </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"> </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;">Intel è impegnata a proteggere la privacy degli utenti. Per ulteriori informazioni,</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;">consultare l'<a href="http://http://www.intel.it/content/www/it/it/privacy/intel-online-privacy-notice-summary.html">Informativa sulla riservatezza dei dati personali di Intel</a>. </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;"> </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;"><a href="http://http://www.intel.it/content/www/it/it/legal/terms-of-use.html">Informazioni legali</a> | <a href="http://http://www.intel.it/content/www/it/it/legal/trademarks.html">Marchi</a> © Intel Corporation. Tutti i diritti riservati.</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;">*Tutti gli altri marchi e nomi di prodotti appartengono ai rispettivi proprietari.</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;">** Intel non è responsabile del contenuto dei siti esterni alla propria rete intranet. </span></p>
</td>
</tr>
